408\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>Obtenha uma firewall que adapta-se \u00e0 sua rede, para que n\u00e3o precise de<br \/>adaptar a sua rede ao firewall.<\/p><p>O Sophos Firewall oferece os recursos e a versatilidade de que precisa para <br \/>proteger o seu ambiente \u00fanico.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-020eb5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"020eb5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\t\t<div class=\"ekit-btn-wraper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:sales@devlop.systems\" class=\"elementskit-btn  whitespace--normal\" id=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\tContacte-nos\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d705dc1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d705dc1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;,&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c6c6b5 elementor-view-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"7c6c6b5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21.708 5.267C17.516 4.515 15.783 3.96 12 2.25 8.217 3.959 6.484 4.515 2.292 5.267 1.532 17.303 11.277 21.46 12 21.75c.723-.291 10.467-4.447 9.708-16.483Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-214be6b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"214be6b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-81bff1f\" data-id=\"81bff1f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ca0fcd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4ca0fcd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Sophos Xstream Protection<\/h4><p>A Arquitetura Xstream do Sophos Firewall protege a sua rede contra as amea\u00e7as mais recentes, enquanto acelera o tr\u00e1fego importante de SaaS, SD-WAN e aplica\u00e7\u00f5es na nuvem.<\/p><h4>Descodifica\u00e7\u00e3o TLS 1.3<\/h4><p>Remova os pontos cegos com a inspe\u00e7\u00e3o inteligente TLS r\u00e1pida e eficaz, compat\u00edvel com os padr\u00f5es mais recentes com exce\u00e7\u00f5es abrangentes e ferramentas de pol\u00edticas do tipo apontar e clicar para facilitar o seu trabalho.<\/p><h4>Inspe\u00e7\u00e3o Profunda de Pacotes<\/h4><p>Interrompa os ransomwares e as viola\u00e7\u00f5es mais recentes com inspe\u00e7\u00e3o profunda de pacotes de fluxo de alto desempenho, incluindo IPS Next-Gen, prote\u00e7\u00e3o da Web e controlo da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o, bem como Deep Learning e sandbox com tecnologia SophosLabs Intelix.<\/p><h4>Acelera\u00e7\u00e3o de Aplica\u00e7\u00f5es<\/h4><p>Acelere o tr\u00e1fego de SaaS, SD-WAN e na nuvem, como VoIP, v\u00eddeos e outras aplica\u00e7\u00f5es confi\u00e1veis de modo autom\u00e1tico ou aplicando as suas pr\u00f3prias pol\u00edticas, colocando-os no Xstream FastPath para otimizar o desempenho.<\/p><h4>Sophos Desempenho avan\u00e7ado<\/h4><p>A S\u00e9rie XGS oferece desempenho do Xstream em todas as faixas de pre\u00e7os para oferecer a prote\u00e7\u00e3o que voc\u00ea precisa nas atuais redes diversas, distribu\u00eddas e criptografadas.<\/p><h4>Powered By Xstream<\/h4><p>Acelere e descarregue o tr\u00e1fego importante de SaaS, SD-WAN e da nuvem em n\u00edvel de hardware, enquanto adiciona espa\u00e7o para desempenho do TLS e da inspe\u00e7\u00e3o profunda de pacotes com Xstream Flow Processors integrados.<\/p><h4>Conectividade de alta velocidade<\/h4><p>Personalize as op\u00e7\u00f5es de conectividade j\u00e1 flex\u00edveis da sua firewall com uma ampla gama de m\u00f3dulos complementares para portas de cobre, fibra, Power over Ethernet (PoE) e Wi-Fi de alta velocidade.<\/p><h4>Desempenho espec\u00edfico para o objetivo<\/h4><p>Fique tranquilo sabendo que o seu firewall foi desenvolvido desde a base para lidar com as cargas de trabalho mais exigentes, apresentando uma arquitetura de processador duplo, provisionamento generoso de mem\u00f3ria e armazenamento de estado s\u00f3lido com alto desempenho.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-719fc9e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"719fc9e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1886fdf e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1886fdf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;grid&quot;,&quot;grid_columns_grid&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;grid_rows_grid&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;grid_outline&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;grid_columns_grid_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;grid_columns_grid_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;grid_rows_grid_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;grid_rows_grid_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;fr&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;grid_auto_flow&quot;:&quot;row&quot;,&quot;grid_auto_flow_tablet&quot;:&quot;row&quot;,&quot;grid_